t an Alpaca paper order.</p><ol className="secondarySteps"><li><b>Research</b><span>Use fresh, versioned canonical decisions.</span></li><li><b>Safety checks</b><span>Verify the quote, sizing and execution gates.</span></li><li><b>Paper execution</b><span>Submit qualifying orders and record the result.</span></li></ol><div className="secondaryNotice">This tab runs the research-driven engine. Use Order to review a manually entered paper limit order.</div><button className="secondaryPrimary" disabled={running||!broker?.connected||Boolean(error)} onClick={run}>{running?<RefreshCw size={17}/>:<Play size={17}/>} {running?\'Running paper check…\':\'Run paper check\'}</button>{message&&<p role="status" className="secondaryNotice">{message}</p>}{!broker?.connected&&<p className="secondaryCaption">{broker?.configured?\'Alpaca Paper is currently unreachable. Retry status before running a check.\':\'A paper broker connection is not available. Your deployment administrator must configure it before checks can submit orders.\'}</p>}</section><aside className="secondaryCard"><span className="secondaryEyebrow">LATEST CHECK</span><h2>{runRow?\'Execution summary\':\'No check recorded\'}</h2><p className="secondaryCaption">{when(runRow?.finished_at||runRow?.started_at)}</p><dl className="secondaryFacts">{[[\'Decisions checked\',runRow?.processed],[\'Blocked by gates\',runRow?.blocked],[\'Orders submitted\',runRow?.submitted],[\'Errors\',runRow?.errors]].map(([label,value])=><div key={label}><dt>{label}</dt><dd>{value??\'—\'}</dd></div>)}</dl><p className="secondaryCaption">Current run: {runRow?.status||\'Not recorded\'}. {data?.currentRunEvaluations?.length??0} evaluations belong to this run; earlier evaluations remain in Trade history.</p><p>Not every check results in a trade. Missing research, stale quotes and unmet thresholds can safely produce no order.</p><button className="secondaryTextButton" onClick={load}><RefreshCw size={15}/> Refresh status</button></aside></div>:tab===\'Tr