sName="secondaryPill"><FlaskConical size={15}/> Paper only</span></header>\n {error&&<div className="secondaryNotice" role="alert">{error} <button onClick={load}>Try again</button></div>}\n <section className="paperAccount"><div className="secondaryRow"><h2><FlaskConical size={19}/> Paper Trading <span>(Alpaca)</span></h2><span className={`secondaryPill ${broker?.connected?\'connected\':\'\'}`}>{loading?\'Checking connection\':broker?.connected?\'Connected\':\'Disconnected\'}</span></div><div className="secondaryMetrics"><div><small>Account equity</small><strong>{cash(broker?.equity)}</strong></div><div><small>Cash</small><strong>{cash(broker?.cash)}</strong></div><div><small>Open positions</small><strong>{broker?.positions??\'—\'}</strong></div><div><small>Realized paper P/L</small><strong>{metrics?.trades>0?cash(metrics.netPnl):\'—\'}</strong></div></div><p className="secondaryCaption">Deployment paper account · simulated funds · {broker?.clock?.isOpen===true?\'Market open\':broker?.clock?.isOpen===false?\'Market closed\':\'Market session unavailable\'}</p></section>\n <div className="secondaryTabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Trading Lab views">{[\'Order\',\'Paper check\',\'Trade history\',\'Strategies\'].map(t=><button key={t} id={`lab-${t.replaceAll(\' \',\'-\')}`} role="tab" aria-controls="lab-panel" aria-selected={tab===t} onClick={()=>setTab(t)}>{t}</button>)}</div>\n <div role="tabpanel" id="lab-panel" aria-labelledby={`lab-${tab.replaceAll(\' \',\'-\')}`}>\n {loading?<div className="secondaryEmpty" role="status">Loading paper account and execution history…</div>:tab===\'Order\'?<ManualPaperTicket connected={Boolean(broker?.connected)&&!error} onSubmitted={load}/>:tab===\'Paper check\'?<div className="secondarySplit"><section className="secondaryCard"><div className="secondaryRow"><h2>Automated paper workflow</h2><ShieldCheck size={20}/></div><p>Eligible AURYN research decisions pass quote freshness, market-session and risk checks before the engine can submit an Alpaca paper order.</p><ol className="secondarySteps"><li><b>Research</b><span>Use fresh, versioned canonical decisions.</span></li><li><b>Safety checks</b><span>Verify the quote, sizing and execution gates.</span></li><li><b>Paper execution</b><span>Submit qualifying orders and record the result.</span></li></ol><div className="secondaryNotice">This tab runs the research-driven engine. Use Order to review a manually entered paper limit order.</div><button className="secondaryPrimary" disabled={running||!broker?.connected||Boolean(error)} onClick={run}>{running?<RefreshCw size={17}/>:<Play size={17}/>} {running?\'Running paper check…\':\'Run paper check\'}</button>{message&&<p role="status" className="secondaryNotice">{message}</p>}{!broker?.connected&&<p className="secondaryCaption">{broker?.configured?\'Alpaca Paper is currently unreachable. Retry status before running a check.\':\'A paper broker connection is not available. Your deployment administrator must configure it before checks can submit orders.\'}</p>}</section><aside className="secondaryCard"><span className="secondaryEyebrow">LATEST CHECK</span><h2>{runRow?\'Execution summary\':\'No check recorded\'}</h2><p className="secondaryCaption">{when(runRow?.finished_at||runRow?.started_at)}</p><dl className="secondaryFacts">{[[\'Decisions checked\',runRow?.processed],[\'Blocked by gates\',runRow?.blocked],[\'Orders submitted\',runRow?.submitted],[\'Errors\',runRow?.errors]].map(([label,value])=><div key={label}><dt>{label}</dt><dd>{value??\'—\'}</dd></div>)}</dl><p className="secondaryCaption">Current run: {runRow?.status||\'Not recorded\'}. {data?.currentRunEvaluations?.length??0} evaluations belong to this run; earlier evaluations remain in Trade history.</p><p>Not every check results in a trade. Missing research, stale quotes and unmet thresholds can safely produce no order.</p><button className="secondaryTextButton" onClick={load}><RefreshCw size={15}/> Refresh status</button></aside></div>:tab===\'Tr